abstract: "A 773-record source-grounded Chinese QA dataset. Version 1.1.0 preserves the 506-record legacy release and adds 267 AI-assisted, page-checked adaptations from eight CC BY 3.0 IGO reports. Record-level terms are mixed; independent human review is not claimed."
